# data budget (arithmetic; fractions ASSUMED)
staged J protocol: 3,300 dialogues; 2,000 dialogues ~ 190k ticks (bench README) -> ~3.1e5 ticks
heard syllables ~ (0.2-0.4 of ticks carry another voice) / 3 ticks per syllable -> ~2e4-4e4
life 1e6 ticks -> ~7e4-1.3e5 heard syllables; world2 10-day life (3e5 ticks, ~130 lines/day) -> ~1.3e3 lines ~ 5e3 syllables
GEN weights: ~4.8e4 conjunction units x 257 outputs ~ 1.2e7
syllables per weight ~ 2e-3 - 1e-2   (Chinchilla compute-optimal ~ 20 tokens per parameter, Hoffmann et al. 2022)
child by age 5 ~ 6e7 words (Frank 2023)  -> 3-4 orders of magnitude more than one bench life
